WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A short film shows a road. No broken glass appears.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A question introduces one new word: “smashed.”

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A week later, a participant is asked about an absent detail.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
What was seen and what was suggested are different sources.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A changed answer does not reveal every mechanism of memory.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Source first. Claim second. The evidence isn't a product ad.
